<title>INDIA: India STC tenders for 50,000 tonnes imported wheat.</title>
<headline>India STC tenders for 50,000 tonnes imported wheat.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>India's state-run State Trading Corporation (STC) said on Tuesday that it is tendering for the import of 50,000 tonnes of wheat for arrival by the end of March.</p>
</text>
